"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Teru Japanese Cuisine is a highly rated restaurant located in Santa Barbara, California, offering a variety of traditional Japanese dishes and a unique atmosphere. According to customer reviews, the restaurant boasts fresh seafood options and excellent service, with the owner and staff being particularly welcoming. The menu features a range of options, including sushi, as well as beer and wine, and the ambiance is described as casual yet classy. Customers have praised the quality of the food and the value for money, with some mentioning that it is one of the best sushi restaurants in the area. Overall, Teru Japanese Cuisine appears to be a top choice for those looking for authentic Japanese cuisine in a cozy and inviting setting.\", \"source_segments\": [{\"index\": 0, \"byte_start\": 0, \"byte_end\": 850}, {\"index\": 1, \"byte_start\": 850, \"byte_end\": 866}, {\"index\": 2, \"byte_start\": 866, \"byte_end\": 915}, {\"index\": 3, \"byte_start\": 915, \"byte_end\": 937}, {\"index\": 4, \"byte_start\": 937, \"byte_end\": 1049}, {\"index\": 5, \"byte_start\": 1049, \"byte_end\": 1248}, {\"index\": 6, \"byte_start\": 1248, \"byte_end\": 1306}, {\"index\": 7, \"byte_start\": 1306, \"byte_end\": 1401}, {\"index\": 8, \"byte_start\": 1401, \"byte_end\": 1513}, {\"index\": 9, \"byte_start\": 1513, \"byte_end\": 1533}, {\"index\": 10, \"byte_start\": 1533, \"byte_end\": 1638}], \"answer_sentence_indices\": [0], \"answer_offsets\": [{\"index\": 0, \"byte_start\": 0, \"byte_end\": 164}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
