e a definitive answer to this question based on the given passages.\", \"source_segments\": [{\"index\": 0, \"byte_start\": 0, \"byte_end\": 240}, {\"index\": 1, \"byte_start\": 240, \"byte_end\": 368}, {\"index\": 2, \"byte_start\": 368, \"byte_end\": 545}, {\"index\": 3, \"byte_start\": 545, \"byte_end\": 700}, {\"index\": 4, \"byte_start\": 700, \"byte_end\": 729}, {\"index\": 5, \"byte_start\": 729, \"byte_end\": 998}, {\"index\": 6, \"byte_start\": 998, \"byte_end\": 1176}], \"answer_sentence_indices\": [0], \"answer_offsets\": [{\"index\": 0, \"byte_start\": 0, \"byte_end\": 95}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
